ull,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 参与生产流程及生产线布局优化，解决生产线自动化设备突发技术故障。\n2. 负责自动化设备日常运维，降低设备停机率，保障生产顺畅。\n3. 制定执行设备预防性维护计划，提升设备可靠性与使用寿命。\n4. 主导或参与设备技术改进、革新升级，开展 PLC 程序编写、调试，提升生产效率与产品质量。\n5. 协助新设备引进、调试、验收及相关资料处理。\n6. 负责设备大修计划制定实施，对接外协修理与改造工作。","Require":"1.招聘对象：2027届本科及以上学历毕业生。\n2.专业要求：电气工程、自动化、机器人工程、控制工程、机械电子工程、电子信息工程、测控技术与仪器、软件、计算机、通信等相关专业。\n3.语言要求：通过CET-4。\n4.综合素质：乐观开朗、积极上进、视野开阔、思维敏捷，有较强的自主学习能力、创新能力、沟通能力及抗压能力，善于运用新的工作方法解决问题。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-01T08:43:55","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"f968b7de-e3de-47f6-b776-e54ed29a59e6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151238872,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"重庆铃耀-制造工艺(J28623)","OrgId":2585061,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责量产车型生产工艺的编制、优化、标准化及维护，指导现场生产作业。\n2. 负责新品试制工艺规划，解决试制阶段重难点技术及质量问题。\n3. 为生产线、设备及工具工装设计应用提供技术支持，参与调试优化以提升效率。\n4. 排查解决生产过程技术质量问题，制定预防纠正措施，保障质量稳定。\n5. 参与工艺成本管控与持续改进，推动